effects.mermaid:
flowchart TD
  A[Resumed transcript names a bridge session] --> B{Gate on and another local process serves it}
  B -->|no| C[Connect as usual]
  B -->|yes| D{Turned on explicitly and not a revive}
  D -->|yes| E[Take the session over]
  D -->|no| F[Skip and leave it to the other process]

flowchart TD
  A[Activity after idle] --> B{Gate on}
  B -->|no| D[Next scheduled heartbeat]
  B -->|yes| C{Server granted a longer idle interval and the beat is armed}
  C -->|no| D
  C -->|yes| E{A 429 reply within the seed interval}
  E -->|yes| D
  E -->|no| F[Heartbeat sent now]

flowchart TD
  A[Model request] --> B{Gate on}
  B -->|no| C[No thread tracking]
  B -->|yes| D{Settings unchanged and history only appended}
  D -->|yes| E[Continue the thread]
  D -->|no| F[Start a new thread]

flowchart TD
  A[API request] --> P{First-party}
  P -->|no| N[No dispatch header and no dispatch retry]
  P -->|yes| B{Gate}
  B -->|on| C[Dispatch header v2d]
  B -->|off| D{Auxiliary request}
  D -->|yes| E[No dispatch header]
  D -->|no| F[tengu_cedar_lattice decides v2s or none]
  C --> G{5xx reply or connection error}
  F -->|v2s| G
  F -->|none| I{503 reply}
  E --> I
  G -->|yes| H[Retry once with dispatch header v2p]
  I -->|yes| H

flowchart TD
  A[Feedback drafts check] --> B{First-party and gate on}
  B -->|no| C[Drafts off]
  B -->|yes| D{feedbackDrafts setting off}
  D -->|yes| C
  D -->|no| E[SendFeedback tool and draft notices on]

flowchart TD
  A[Write the shell snapshot] --> B{Gate}
  B -->|off| C[Lines copied with cat]
  B -->|on| D{Builtins work}
  D -->|yes| E[Lines copied with read and printf]
  D -->|no| C

flowchart TD
  A[MCP tool call running] --> B{IDE server or background tasks disabled}
  B -->|yes| C[Stays in the foreground]
  B -->|no| N{Non-interactive session without CLAUDE_AUTO_BACKGROUND_TASKS}
  N -->|yes| C
  N -->|no| D{Gate}
  D -->|on| E[Moved to the background after 120 seconds]
  D -->|off| C

flowchart TD
  A[Start a tool process] --> B{Exclude list variable set}
  B -->|yes| C[Classes from the variable]
  B -->|no| D{tengu_tool_cgroup_exclude_classes serves a list}
  D -->|yes| E[Classes from the served list]
  D -->|no| F[Default classes, mcp included]
  C --> G{mcp among the classes}
  E --> G
  F --> G
  G -->|yes| X[MCP servers run outside the memory cgroup]
  G -->|no| H{CLAUDE_CODE_MCP_MEMORY_CGROUP is off or none}
  H -->|yes| X
  H -->|no| I{Exclude list variable unset and gate served false}
  I -->|yes| X
  I -->|no| Y[MCP servers placed in the memory cgroup]

flowchart TD
  A[Connect a claude.ai connector] --> B{Stateless and gate on}
  B -->|yes| C{Cached reply valid}
  C -->|yes| D[Use the cached reply]
  C -->|no| E[Live initialize]
  B -->|no| E

flowchart TD
  A[Pewter-owl switch read] --> B{Model string empty}
  B -->|yes| C[The switch's own gate decides]
  B -->|no| D{Model name contains it}
  D -->|yes| C
  D -->|no| E[Switch off]

flowchart TD
  A[Plugin menu closed after a change] --> B{Gate}
  B -->|off| C[No reload]
  B -->|on| D{Response running}
  D -->|no| E[Submit reload-plugins now]
  D -->|yes| F[Queue it and show a note]

flowchart TD
  A[Streamed response] --> B{Watchdog on}
  B -->|yes| C{Bytes within the idle limit}
  C -->|no| D[Stream ended with an error]
  C -->|yes| E[Stream continues]
  B -->|no| E

flowchart TD
  A[Foreground Bash command] --> B{bashEditDiffEnabled setting}
  B -->|set| C[Setting decides]
  B -->|unset| D{Auto or bypass mode and bash-first on}
  D -->|yes| E[File changes recorded as an edit diff]
  D -->|no| F[No edit diff]

flowchart TD
  A[Compaction keeps a tail with thinking blocks] --> B{Override variable set}
  B -->|yes| C[The variable decides]
  B -->|no| D{Adaptive thinking}
  D -->|no| E[Thinking kept]
  D -->|yes| F{Gate}
  F -->|on| G[Thinking stripped from later requests]
  F -->|off| E

flowchart TD
  A[Frame drawn or focus gained] --> B{Gate on and xterm.js terminal}
  B -->|no| C[No reset]
  B -->|yes| D{Many glyphs or focus}
  D -->|yes| E[Write the atlas reset sequence]
  D -->|no| C
